constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{6}
-10^{7} ≤ A[i] ≤ 10^{7}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def maxSubArraySum(self, arr, N):
		(maxsum, s) = (-10 ** 7, 0)
		for i in arr:
			s += i
			if maxsum < s:
				maxsum = s
			if s < 0:
				s = 0
		return maxsum
